        "content": "<p>macovedj opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14501\">PR #14501</a> from <code>macovedj:wasi-http-error-classification</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This PR distinguishes refused, unavailable, timed-out, and terminated connections in the p2 and p3 default hooks. It also preserve certificate and TLS alert details when the default request implementation is enabled.</p>\n<p>I used <code>rustix</code> for unsupported-address-family errors, but happy to remove if the dependency addition isn't desirable.</p>\n</blockquote>",
